# The herds pack (packs/herds): groups. Each herd starts with 20 animals;
# well fed, they calve, split when big and join when small; wolves take
# two at a bite. The grass sets how many there can be: about 50 000
# animals by the third day, then level, in a few hundred rows.
#
#   make run ARGS="play saves/herds --scenario scenarios/herds.scenario"
rules ../packs/herds
seed 8
size 192 128
terrain water_level 0 rock_on_soil 0 rock_on_water 0
start herd 1 / 2000
start wolf 1 / 4000
start herd at (5, 5) with (heads = 150)
